Practical 5 :-
Classify students as topper, average, and fail using rule-based reasoning

Prolog Code:-
% Student marks
marks(rahul, 90).
marks(amit, 65).
marks(priya, 30).
marks(sita, 85).
marks(rohan, 45).

% Rules for student performance
result(Student, topper) :-
    marks(Student, Marks),
    Marks >= 80.

result(Student, average) :-
    marks(Student, Marks),
    Marks >= 40,
    Marks < 80.

result(Student, fail) :-
    marks(Student, Marks),
    Marks < 40.


Output Query:-
1.) result(amit, Result).
2.) result(priya, Result).

Output:-
1.) Result = average.
2.) Result = fail.
